# Allow-list: the build context holds only what the two images need. Anything else,
# .env and local data first, never reaches the Docker daemon.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!data/corpus.lock
!data/golden/questions.jsonl
!deploy/docker/
!web/
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/.lighthouseci
web/e2e/**/*-snapshots
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
